  - Soulbits models defaults (Complete, `5a10a51`): replaced non-existent `soulchat-v1`/`soul-embed-v1`/`soul-tts-v1`/`whisper` with real catalog ids (LLM `qwen-35-9b` default, embeddings `harrier-oss-v1-0-6b`, TTS `harmonyspeech`/`kitten-tts-*`/`openvoice_*`/`chatterbox*`, STT `faster-whisper-*`, vision multimodal). Guard test: fallback ids ⊆ live catalog.
  - CreateAI profile picker (Complete, `7b3eb74`): wizard can link an existing CharacterProfile (bottom sheet selector, preview card, prefill Name/Personality, pencil → CharacterProfileEdit, hide photo/personality); `prefillProfileId` param honored; alias conflict → friendly alert.
  - CreateAI Advanced Settings (Complete, `91fe902`): module pickers always visible via shared `EntityModuleSelectorWithActions` (selector + edit + create); deleted inline `ModuleConfigPicker` + dead-end "connect to HL/Cloud" warning; focus-reload on return.
  - FAB speed dial (Complete, `3167a8e`): CharactersScreen create/import entry reworked to Animated speed dial (rotate ✕, two glass pills — Create Profile + Import Character Card (PNG / JSON), testIDs for Maestro).
  - Connection cert-flow UX (Complete, `353bf97`): security-mode sticky-ref reset, cert-verification-failed alert w/ reset offer, "Reset Security Mode" button; re-pair via Insecure-SSL for LAN self-signed cert.
